luxon-server (1.4) UNRELEASED; urgency=low

  * Added Mac OS Support
  * Added CI builds for Mac OS (amd64, aarch64), FreeBSD (amd64),
    OpenBSD (amd64), Windows Vista (i386), Linux (i686, armhf), Java 17, DOS
  * Added WebAssembly (preview 1 / WASI) support
  * Several IPv6 fixes
  * Improved CMake option constraints
  * Improved RaisEvent handler
  * Fixed Tracy on Windows
  * Allow disabling TickTimeBudget
  * Replaced stackfull coroutines with command restarting
  * Implemented FFI
  * Fixed ChangeInterestGroup implementation
  * Updated configuration format to unambiguious
  * Implemented multiprocessing for GameServer
  * Removed "external servers" configuration in favor or "proxies"
  * Fixed crash with ENet peer callback reset
  * Fixed lobby/app stat confusion
  * Send MasterServer stats as unreliable events
  * Defer connection destruction until after handlers are done
  * Several SQL lobby fixes/improvements
  * Do not hold shared pointer when joining game, just ID
  * Fixed loss of -0.0 value
  * Make sure peer is already in game when PluginBase::OnJoinGame is called
  * Revert game join properly
  * Handle GameServer disconnects properly, fixing master client confusion
    on disconnect
  * Allow ser Message/Value to be non-owning, avoiding some data copies
  * More complete GP Binary v1.6 implementation
  * Build Debian packages in CI

 -- Tuxifan <tuxifan@posteo.de>  Fri, 10 Jul 2026 13:06:38 +0200
